#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Libusb"
msgstr "Configurando Libusb"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To access raw USB devices (those not treated as a disk by the mass-storage "
"driver), appropriate support must be available in the kernel.  Check your "
"kernel configuration:"
msgstr ""
"Para acessar dispositivos brutos USB (aqueles não tratados como um disco "
"pelo controlador de armazenamento em massa), o suporte apropriado precisa "
"estar disponível no núcleo. Verifique a configuração do seu núcleo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "Support for Host-side USB"
msgstr "Suporte para USB do Lado do Anfitrião"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For more details on setting up USB devices, see <xref linkend=\"usb-device-"
"issues\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Para mais detalhes a respeito do como configurar dispositivos USB, veja-se "
"<xref linkend=\"usb-device-issues\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libusb"
msgstr "Instalação do libusb"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libusb</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>libusb</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>Doxygen</application> is installed and you wish to build the"
" API documentation, issue the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se o <application>Doxygen</application> estiver instalado e você desejar "
"construir a documentação da API, [então] emita os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd doc                &amp;&amp;\n"
"  doxygen -u doxygen.cfg &amp;&amp;\n"
"  make docs              &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd doc               &amp;&amp;\n"
"  doxygen -u doxygen.cfg &amp;&amp;\n"
"  make docs              &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to run the tests, ensure that you have the <xref "
"linkend=\"umockdev\"/> package installed and then add the <option>--enable-"
"tests-build</option> switch to configure. After doing this, issue "
"<command>make check</command> to run the tests."
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja executar os testes, certifique-se de ter o pacote <xref "
"linkend=\"umockdev\"/> instalado e então adicione a chave <option>--enable-"
"tests-build</option> para configurar. Depois de fazer isso, emita "
"<command>make check</command> para executar os testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the API documentation, install it using the following commands "
"as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu a documentação da API, [então] instale-a usando os "
"seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/libusb.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/doc/libusb-&libusb-version;/apidocs &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/api-1.0/* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/libusb-&libusb-version;/apidocs</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/doc/libusb-&libusb-version;/apidocs &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644   doc/api-1.0/* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/libusb-&libusb-version;/apidocs</userinput>"

